'''Icecream''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing the [[Summer Box '26|2026 Summer box]] during the [[Summer Event 2026|2026 Summer Event]].

== Appearance ==
The handle is an ice cream cone, with various toppings protruding from the guard. The blade is made of Neapolitan ice cream, with chocolate on the bottom, vanilla in the middle, and strawberry on the top.

== Trivia ==
* It has a chroma counterpart under the name [[Chroma Icecream]]. It can be obtained via the same event box, although there's a smaller chance of unboxing it.

